# Architecture

- Core principle: the AI fills the canvas; it never creates the canvas.
- Never generate free layouts, free color/font pickers, or free element positioning.
- Visuals come only from locked SVG templates + `config.json` under `templates/brands`.
- Allowed dynamic fields only: label, headline, subtitle, body, cta, mainImage, caption, hashtags, altText.
- Never invent prices, numbers, testimonials, clients, results, or statistics.
- Publish only when content status is `APPROVED`. External ops must be idempotent.
- Prefer feature modules under `src/features/*` and providers under `src/providers/*`.
